To kalokairi teleiose kai mazi kai oi baretes diakopes me tous theious. O Khari Poter, o panexupnos mikros magos me ta gualakia kai ta atithasa mallia, epistrephei ste Skhole Khogkouarts kai xanabriskei tous philous tou, ton Ron kai ten Ermione. Ki eno e skholike khronia arkhizei eukharista, e apodrase tou Seiriou Mplak, enos epikindunou dolophonou, apo ten tromere phulake tou Azkampan kai e pheme oti kunega ton Khari erkhetai na anastatosei olous tous mathetes. Telika poia einai e skhese tou Mplak me tous goneis tou Khari; Giati o niophertos kathegetes Loupin pheretai toso paraxena; Tha ta katapherei, arage, o Khari na antimetopisei tous phrourous tou Khogkouarts, tous phoberous kai tromerous Paraphrones, kai na anakalupsei ti krubetai piso apo ten upothese-Mplak; To trito biblio tes seiras me tis peripeteies tou Khari Poter einai exisou euphues, sunarpastiko, diaskedastiko kai apolaustiko me ta prota biblia. Exallou einai pia gegonos: oi <>opadoi ekhoun plemmurisei ton kosmo olo."í
êDen mporo" tou eipa. "Den mporo!"
"Sigoura;" me rotese autos.
"Nai. Polu tha ethela na mporousa na statho mprosta tes kai na tes po ti niotho... Ksero, omos, oti den mporo."
O Khontros kathise san ton Bouda pano s' ekeines tis phrikhtes mple poluthrones tou grapheiou tou. Khamogelase, me koitaxe sta matia kai, khamelonontas te phone opos ekane kathe phora pou ethele na ton akousoun prosektika, mou eipe:
"Na sou po mia istoria..."
Kai khoris na perimenei na sumphoneso, o Khorkhe arkhise na aphegeitai.
O Ntemian einai enas anesukhos nearos phoitetes pou prospathei na anakalupsei ton eauto tou. Oi anazeteseis tou ton kateuthunoun ston "Khontro", enan polu idiorruthmo psukhanalute pou ton boetha na antimetopisei te zoe kai na brei apanteseis sta erotemata tou me enan tropo polu prototupo: se kathe sunantese, tou diegeitai apo mia istoria, klasike e monterna, "anatolitike" e "dutikotrope", pou pegazei apo te laike prophorike paradose e apeutheias apo te phantasia tou "Khontrou". Oi istories arkhizoun na leitourgoun os paraboles, kai o Ntemian katasigazei tis agonies kai tis anasphaleies tou, orimazontas mallon, para briskontas "etoimes luseis" kai "suntages eutukhias"... Oi skheseis metaxu therapeute kai therapeuomenou den einai -oute autes- sumbatikes kai anamenomenes. Kabgades, diaphonies, sumpatheia, antipatheia, misos kai agape aphenontai eleuthera na ekphrastoun, demiourgontas me auton ton tropo duo monadikous logotekhnikous eroes me sarka kai osta, prosphileis kai oikeious ston anagnoste. Kamia skhese edo me to stereotupo tou psukhanalutikou ntibaniou kai tou orizontiomenou paskhontos. O dialogos kai e antallage empeirion kai apopseon, dianthismenos me exairetikes aphegeseis istorion, topothetoun to "Na sou po mia istoria" sten kategoria ton logotekhnikon biblion, askhetos ean, pagkosmios, topotheteitai kato apo ten etiketta: "Biblia autognosias kai autoboetheias"."ğ
