Meta ten xaphnike epithese ton stratioton Ork, e Suntrophia tou Dakhtulidiou dialuetai. Kaneis pleon den xerei ti tha ginei me ten apostole tous. Tha katapherei o Phronto, o Dakhtulidokoubaletes, mazi me ton pisto tou uperete ton Sam na phtasoun ste khora tou ekhthrou kai na katastrepsoun to paniskhuro Dakhtulidi; Kai tha brethoun xana arage oloi mazi; Oi dunameis tou kakou tous parakolouthoun se kathe tous bema. Idiaitera o tromeros magos Sarouman.."ö
óE <>einai to teleutaio ergo pou oloklerose e Tzeen Osten, suggrapheas tes poludiabasmenes <>kai pollon allon agapemenon muthistorematon. Se touto to muthistorema, kata pollous to aristourgema tes, e Osten aphegeitai ten istoria tou polukumantou erota tes Annas Elliot, e opoia, neare kopela akome, kanei to lathos na upokupsei sten peitho mias epistethias philes. To thema parousiazetai me leptaisthesia, romantike diathese kai, bebaia, me ton gnosto aristotekhniko kai aparamillo tropo tes Osten - te lepte eironeia, ten kaustike satira, ten kophtere psukhologike kai ethographike matia kai tous zontanous dialogous - , e de aphegese parousiazei spoudaies kainotomies, oi opoies prooionizontai polu metagenesteres exelixeis sto eidos tou muthistorematos."ö
óE Khariet kai o Nteibint Lobat epithumoun ta idia pragmata: aphosiose, agape, oikogeneiake zoe kai, pano ap' ola, ena diko tous spiti. Peismatika apokommenoi apo te moda tes dekaetias tou '60, apophasizoun na pantreutoun kai na baloun ta themelia tou paradeisou tous s' ena megalo biktoriano spiti. Sten arkhe ola einai eidulliaka. Ta paidia gemizoun te zoe tous kai oi suggeneis xanantamonoun sto trapezi ton Khristougennon kai tou Paskha gia na apolausoun te thalpore tou spitiou ton Lobat. Sten pempte egkumosune, ostoso, kati den paei kala. To embruo arkhizei apo polu noris na striphogurizei biaia sten koilia tes Khariet. Ustera apo ena duskolo toketo, to neogenneto anaptussetai takhutera apo ta sunethismena mora. Epithetiko kai astorgo, gnorizei gregora ten enstiktode antipatheia ton adelphion tou. E allokote uparxe tou katastrephei ten eutukhismene oikogeneiake zoe tous."ö	
ó	Ta <>tou Kosta Moursela einai ena muthistorema pou prokalei, erethizei, exorgizei, erotiko, aisthesiako, khudaio, apotropaio, dosmeno apla, me khioumor, eironeia kai kaustike diathese. Sugkhronoi Amlet, sugkhronoi Zormpades, agiopoiemena koproskula, pornes, mporntela, geitonies, paragkes, numphomaneis, aunanes, papatzedes, mikroastoi, proen proletarioi, proen ideologoi kai nun <>karieristes, kalpedes, xephtiles, anthropoi pou eroteuontai prosopa mes' apo kathrephtes kai okhi ta idia ta prosopa, mia toikhographia epokhes kai anthropon, diegemena asthmatika, paraphora, oma m' enan phrenere realismo pou ta kanei ola na diastellontai, na megethunontai kai na ginontai okeanos, thalassa, khroma, mousike, almura, erotas. E istoria enos thesei dianooumenou pou ek ton usteron diapistonei pos <>kai enos allou -phusei dianooumenou- pou apodeiknuei me te zoe tou, ten praxe pos ola tha mporouse na eikhan sumbei kai allios kai pos krima gia to <>mas mia kai kaneis mas den glitonei apo ten telike krise, apo ton teliko kai moiraio apologismo. Akoma, e istoria mias gunaikas pou oso buthizetai stous sumbibasmous tes, oso adeiazei, toso plesiazei sten pleroteta, oso apomakrunetai apo ton erota, toso ton anakaluptei. (APO TEN PAROUSIASE STO OPISThOPhULLO TOU BIBLIOU)"û

ø
A pitch-perfect, emotionally riveting debut novel about the fracturing of a marriage and a family - from an award-winning young writer with superb storytelling instincts.
Life hasn't always been perfect for Abe and Cassandra Green, but an afternoon on the San Francisco Bay might be as good as it gets. Abe is a rheumatologist, piloting his coveted new boat. Cassandra is a sculptor, finally gaining modest attention for her art. Their beautiful daughter, Elizabeth, is heading to Harvard in the fall. Somehow, they've made things work. But then, out of nowhere, they plunge into a terrible fight. Cassandra has been unfaithful. In a fit of fury, Abe throws himself off the boat.
A love story that begins with the end of a marriage, The Violet Hourfollows a modern family through past and present, from the funeral home in the Washington suburbs where Cassandra and her siblings grow up to the San Francisco public health clinic where Abe and Cassandra first meet. As the Greens navigate the passage of time--the expectations of youth, the concessions of middle age, the headiness of desire, the bitterness of loss--they must come to terms with the fragility of their intimacy, the strange legacies they inherit from their parents, and the kind of people they want to be. Exquisitely written, The Violet Houris the deeply moving story of a family suddenly ripped apart, but then just possibly reborn."ı
úE Lismpet Salanter, idiophuia stous upologistes, de distazei mprosta se tipota prokeimenou na petukhei to stokho tes. Den xekhna kai de sugkhorei, kai otan sunanta diaphthora kai kakopoiese, idios apenanti se gunaikes, einai aneleete.
Kerussontas polemo s' autous pou kinoun ta nemata tes biomekhanias tou emporiou sarkos khresimopoiei tis ikanotetes tes os khaker gia na boethesei sten ereuna pou ekhei xekinesei o Mikael Mploumkbist, ekdotes tou periodikou Millennium. Empleketai, omos, athela tes se mia diple dolophonia, eno e astunomia ten kunega kai gia enan trito phono. Ola ta stoikheia ten enokhopoioun kai ta daktulika tes apotupomata ekhoun brethei sto oplo tou egklematos. Kathos oles oi dunameis ste Souedia alla kai apophasismenoi egklematies einai sta ikhne tes, e Lismpet den ekhei alle epiloge: prepei na anakalupsei kai na xeskepasei ten aletheia protou einai arga gia ten idia tes te zoe.
To deutero biblio tes trilogias Millennium pou ekhei sarosei ta brabeia kai ekhei enthousiasei kritikous kai anagnostes se olo ton kosmo. Ena mnemeiodes politikooikonomiko alla kai erotiko thriler pou prokalese aisthese se ole ten Europe!"ş
ûAuto einai to skandalo gia to opoio o politismos den mporei na kanei kamia soteria skepse. To mono pou gnorizei einai na me deikhnei to dromo, alla ten apatele parakampse,na men prospherei ton upno, alla to krebati, na dinei biblia, okhi ten aletheia. Olokleros sugkrotei ena zotiko kai meizon pseudos. Kai o ana tous aionas taxidiotes de briskei pou na xekourasei ton iskio tou."ş
ûCarole King takes us from her early beginnings in Brooklyn, to her remarkable success as one of the world's most acclaimed songwriting and performing talents of all time. A NATURAL WOMAN chronicles King's extraordinary life, drawing readers into her musical world, including her phenomenally successful #1 album Tapestry, and into her journey as a performer, mother, wife and present-day activist. Deeply personal, King's long-awaited memoir offers readers a front-row seat to the woman behind the legend.
The book will include dozens of photos from King's childhood, her own family, and behind-the-scenes images from her performances."
ş
O Khari perimenei sten odo Pribet 4. To Tagma tou Phoinika erkhetai na ton phugadepsei krupha apo ton Bolntemort kai tous opadous tou, an ta katapherei. Einai pia ora o Khari na analabei drase kai na prospathesei na pherei se peras to skhedon akatorthoto kathekon pou tou aphese o kathegetes Ntamplntor.
Sto ebdomo kai teleutaio biblio, e Tz.K. Rooulingk apokaluptei me theamatiko tropo tis apanteseis pou oloi perimename kai apodeiknuei oti ta biblia tou Khari Poter tha diabastoun xana kai xana kai xana..."‚
ÿO eroas tes istorias buthizetai apolaustika ste mageia mias bathias diaphthoras. Diaprattei skhedon ola ta gnosta egklemata, odegei ton eauto tou sten apolute parakme kai parabiazei eutharsos okto toulakhiston apo tis deka entoles, kathos kai merikes alles pou den perilambanontai ston katalogo. Sto emerologio tou perigraphei te drase tou prospathontas na men paraleipsei kamia aiskhre leptomereia. Kai aphenei na diagraphei anaglupha e eikona enos kosmou zopherou, epikindunou alla kai dikaiou. Tou dikou mas."␀␀ˆ@"	…ëQ¸@"	…ëQ¸@"	…ëQ¸@"	)\Âõ(@"	=
